{"ref":"BDB, יְקוּם","hw":"יְקוּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְקוּם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>substance, existence</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־הַיְקוּם</span> = <em>all that subsists</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:4\" href=\"/Genesis.7.4\">Gn 7:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:23\" href=\"/Genesis.7.23\">23</a> (man and animal), in more limited sense <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.6\">Dt 11:6</a>.","next":"BDB, יָקִים","prev":"BDB, אַלְקוּם³"}